IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fl-income-tax-limit`

-- Fla. Const. art. VII s 5(a) -- cases from the seat of the individual. Every assertion is a claim about the encoding on stated
-- facts, not about the law. Expected values written by hand from the text.

#ASSERT `Do I pay Florida income tax` TRUE EQUALS `no Florida statute in the deposited law taxes my income, and s 5(a) would cap any such tax at the federal or state allowance`
#ASSERT `Do I pay Florida income tax` FALSE EQUALS `s 5(a) does not protect me: I am neither a Florida resident nor a Florida citizen`
-- With an allowance of nil, the ceiling is nil.
#ASSERT `What is the most Florida could tax my income` TRUE 0 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the most Florida could tax my income` TRUE 500 EQUALS JUST 500
#ASSERT `What is the most Florida could tax my income` FALSE 500 EQUALS NOTHING
